The MIT license above applies to the source code of this project only.

--- Third-party components -----------------------------------------------------

This repository vendors no third-party code. One component is loaded at
runtime by the optional camera OCR feature and is not covered by the license
above:

  Tesseract.js - Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js

It is fetched from a CDN only when the user invokes camera scanning. Removing
that feature removes the component entirely.

